`--record adr/NNNN` without a title reads the ADR's `Confirmation:` bullet, wrapped across two
lines: the first sentence becomes the title, cut to 100 characters with an ellipsis, and the
direction, source and record anchor take the ADR defaults.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
