vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
macro_stubs:
  core.macros.date: "2026-10-15"
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/specs/adr/0007-plans-close-their-items.md --
---
id: adr/0007
summary: Plans close their open items
status: accepted
---

# Plans close their open items

## Decision

Closing a plan closes its items.

## Consequences

- Items stay on disk after they close.
- Confirmation: every plan that reaches develop's done closes the open items linked to it,
  and a failed or cancelled plan returns them to open. A second sentence follows.
-- cmd --
booping specs open-items add --record adr/0007
-- exit --
0
